{"id":"vod_sn_35782","vodId":"35782","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔豆传奇","name_cn":"魔豆传奇","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d43f9a40e8f80eaee4f2c540bdb01c5c.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一颗名为可伦星的美丽星球上，邪恶的欧帝于无意之中得到了拥有强大法力的魔豆，别小看这小小的一颗豆子，它却能够激发出人们心底潜藏的欲望，制造出无限的麻烦。类似的豆子共有七颗，野心勃勃的欧帝打算将它们全部掌握在手中，以此称霸世界。　　熊猫果王潘欧识破了欧帝的阴谋，它派出了女儿可可来到可伦星，去那里寻找一位“救世主”。皮皮（谢洁贞 配音）是一只个性有些胆小的熊猫，连它自己也没有想到的是，自己竟然就是这位救世主，然而，皮皮并不想去拯救什么世界，也不想成为英雄，它只想能够进入电视台工作，待在心爱的拉拉身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tVsBSkDEhG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KdZd5vS35g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9umGhr79Ds1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9qgZ6v4qAe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TTQXQwdS6W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sBraWGRf5i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k8yCiF3swD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2k2pKC9EF11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pUn99phXDE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1hhk4yidjA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ddg7aKXCTK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wz4CC6cUkk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1bP7AJ9fHK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/chTH3ixBc11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/2023